<title>USA: BOXING-JONES KNOCKS OUT GRIFFIN FOR WBC LIGHT HEAVY CROWN.</title>
<headline>BOXING-JONES KNOCKS OUT GRIFFIN FOR WBC LIGHT HEAVY CROWN.</headline>
<dateline>LEDYARD, Connecticut 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roy Jones Jr knocked out fellow American Montell Griffin in the first round to take back the World Boxing Council light heavyweight crown Thursday at Foxwoods Casino.</p>
<p>Referee Arthur Mercante counted Griffin out at 2:31 of the first round.</p>
